---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
const title = 'Privacy Policy — Connietech';
const description = 'How Connietech collects, uses, and protects your information.';
---
<Base lang="en" title={title} description={description} url="https://connietech.com/privacy">
  <Header lang="en" />
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 prose prose-brand">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: 2025-01-01</p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>Connietech is a sourcing partner for infrastructure integrators operating in South Florida, LATAM, and the Caribbean.</p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Contact details you submit via our forms: name, company, email, phone.</li>
      <li>Project details you choose to share: type, budget, timeline, location, description, questions, referral source.</li>
      <li>Basic technical data from your browser (standard server logs).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we use your information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To respond to your inquiries and provide sourcing proposals.</li>
      <li>To improve our services and communications.</li>
      <li>To comply with legal obligations.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Legal basis</h2>
    <p>We process your data based on your consent (when you submit forms) and our legitimate interest in responding to business inquiries.</p>

    <h2>Data retention</h2>
    <p>We keep form submissions for as long as needed to serve you and meet legal/accounting requirements, then delete or anonymize them.</p>

    <h2>Sharing</h2>
    <p>We do not sell your data. We may share limited data with vendors or logistics partners strictly to fulfill your sourcing request.</p>

    <h2>International transfers</h2>
    <p>We operate across multiple regions. When transferring data, we use reasonable safeguards consistent with applicable laws.</p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>You can request access, correction, deletion, or restriction of your data. Contact us to exercise these rights.</p>

    <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
    <p>We currently do not use analytics cookies. Essential cookies, if any, are only used to run the site. If we add analytics in the future, we will update this policy.</p>

    <h2>Third‑party assets</h2>
    <p>This site loads some third‑party assets (e.g., images, fonts) over HTTPS. These providers may receive your IP address to deliver content.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Email: <a href="mailto:connie@connietech.com">connie@connietech.com</a><br/>Phone: <a href="tel:+13051234567">+1 (305) 123‑4567</a><br/>Address: Miami, Florida, USA</p>
  </main>
  <Footer lang="en" />
</Base>
